TI  - Allogenic succession in Late Ordovician reefs from southeast China: a response to the Cathaysian orogeny
T2  - ESTONIAN JOURNAL OF EARTH SCIENCES
LA  - English
CP  - 4th Annual Meeting of IGCP Project 591
