TI  - RUDISTS AS GREGARIOUS SEDIMENT-DWELLERS, NOT REEF-BUILDERS, ON CRETACEOUS CARBONATE PLATFORMS
T2  - PALAEOGEOGRAPHY PALAEOCLIMATOLOGY PALAEOECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - ALGAL SYMBIOSIS
KW  - GROWTH
KW  - CRASSOSTREA
KW  - EVOLUTION
